Kinison~
A massive guardian is seated here, prepared to mete out justice.
~
Before you stands a prodigious figure holding a scale outstretched in one hand,
and a sickle drawn and poised to strike in the other.  Affixed upon it's brow;
an opaque blindfold makes it impossible for this figure to see you, though you
can feel him watching, observing, and sizing you up none the less.  Mental
images of your past deeds flash in mind, the good, the bad, the sketchy on
goings that have been your life resurface for an instant.  You snap back to
your surroundings and realize you've been judged.  The Kinison guards your
path, and only the righteous may pass.    
~
