Zulthorator~
Zulthorator smiles kindly as he prepares to lead you to your quarters.
~
Shrouded in the finest of silks and linens, Zulthorator appears well
paid by the adventurers who lay their heads in his beds.  A retired
adventurer himself, he is quite eager to hear all the happenings of
each weary warrior that passes through.  Battle scars line his forearms,
and as he stretches his right hand towards you to hand you your key you
notice that he is missing three fingers.  You can assume by his wounds
that this furfoot halfling was no stranger to danger, and evidently
not all that fond of healing either.
~
